 ## Retries
 
-A capture that times out is tried again, up to 3 attempts in all, one after the other.
+A capture that times out is tried again with a growing pause between attempts. The attempt limit and pause lengths
+are defined in [the capture implementation](../../larder/capture.py).
+
+During the gateway's busy Friday period, back-to-back attempts all landed in the same slow interval, leaving
+confirmed pantry orders for a volunteer to capture by hand. Replaying those timeouts in the sandbox showed that
+more attempts with growing pauses recovered almost all of them. The team accepted a longer wait on the member's
+confirmation page to reduce manual captures.
 
